-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 3, §3.4 תקופת ניסיון וקביעות
-- Probation and tenure of elementary-school teachers: what a year of work
-- is, how long probation lasts, the supervisors' visits and evaluations, the
-- yearly timetable of opinions and recommendations, extensions and their
-- limits, who decides, and the warnings to uncertified teachers.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `3.4 תקופת ניסיון וקביעות`

-- The district office (הלשכה המחוזית), the general supervisor (המפקח הכולל)
-- and the head of the religious education division are this section's own;
-- the rest come from common.
DECLARE `3.4 party` IS ONE OF
    `a takanon party` HAS `who` IS A Party
    `the district office`
    `the general supervisor`
    `the head of the religious education division`

DECLARE `probation action` IS ONE OF
    `visit the teacher`
    `arrange a visit by someone versed in the subject`
    `send each principal the principal's opinion forms, in two copies, for every teacher finishing probation that year`
    `return the completed forms together`
    `take the principal's opinion into account in deciding on her continued work`
    `pass the forms and the treatment sheet to the general supervisor`
    `state his position on the principal's evaluations and add his own remarks`
    `sum up his visits in the treatment sheet in an opinion closing with an explicit, reasoned recommendation` HAS `the recommendation made` IS A `recommendation`
    `submit the recommendation with the principal's opinion to the district supervisor`
    `check and decide the mismatch` HAS `after consulting the district's supervisor of religious education` IS A BOOLEAN
    `extend probation a second time` HAS `the union consented beforehand` IS A BOOLEAN, `on exceptional grounds` IS A BOOLEAN
    `refer the request to the union's branch`
    `consult the district's supervisor of religious education before deciding`
    `check her certification and private address`
    `send the notice of a further year of probation`
    `weigh tenure or a further year for pedagogical reasons, with reasons`
    `send a warning letter in the set form`
    `send the copies of the warning letters to the personnel division together at the end`
    `send the copy to the head of the religious education division`
    `pass the copy on to the personnel division`
    `send an extension notice`
    `send a copy of the notice to the owner`

DECLARE `recommendation` IS ONE OF
    `grant tenure`
    `extend probation`
    `sub-supervision and dismissal for pedagogical reasons`
    `administrative dismissal`

DECLARE `stage of an uncertified teacher` IS ONE OF `stage A`, `stage A+`, `other stage`

@desc A teaching employee on probation, as far as section 3.4 asks about it.
DECLARE `probationer` HAS
    `certified when hired`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `year of work in which certified`       IS A NUMBER  @desc 0 if not certified during probation
    `a kindergarten teacher hired for general or professional teaching` IS A BOOLEAN
    `uncertified stage`                     IS A `stage of an uncertified teacher`
    `years added by extension notices`      IS A NUMBER  @desc 0 if no extension notice was sent

§§ `1 A year of work`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_1__subpara_a
GIVEN `days actually worked in official institutions` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a year of work` `days actually worked in official institutions` IF
    `days actually worked in official institutions` AT LEAST 150

-- 1ב: work outside official education does not count towards probation,
-- even where it counted towards professional seniority.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_1__subpara_b
GIVEN `in official education` IS A BOOLEAN, `counted for professional seniority` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `counts towards probation` `in official education` `counted for professional seniority` IF
    `in official education`

§§ `2-6 How long probation lasts`

-- 2: a certified teacher in an official institution: 2 years of work at a
-- third of a position at least (printed "3 / 1"), unless an extension notice
-- was sent on the supervision's reasoned opinion; never proposed for tenure
-- after one year of probation only.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_2
GIVEN `years added by an extension notice` IS A NUMBER @desc 0 where no notice, resting on the supervision's reasoned opinion, was sent
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `years of probation of a certified teacher` `years added by an extension notice` IS
    2 PLUS `years added by an extension notice`

`least position fraction for a year of probation` MEANS 1/3

GIVEN `years of probation done` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be proposed for tenure` `years of probation done` IF
    `years of probation done` GREATER THAN 1

-- 3: an uncertified teacher: 4 years at a third of a position at least,
-- unless an extension notice was sent on the supervision's reasoned opinion.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_3
GIVEN `years added by an extension notice` IS A NUMBER @desc 0 where no notice, resting on the supervision's reasoned opinion, was sent
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `years of probation of an uncertified teacher` `years added by an extension notice` IS
    4 PLUS `years added by an extension notice`

-- 4: one certified during probation: 3 years if certified in her second
-- year of work (א), 4 if in her third or fourth (ב). F-3.4-a: one certified
-- during her FIRST year is not covered; she is read as certified (2 years).
-- One certified after her fourth year had served an uncertified teacher's
-- 4 years (3) by then.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_4 akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_4__subpara_a akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_4__subpara_b
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER @desc the year of work in which she was certified
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `years of probation of one certified during it` y IS
    IF y EQUALS 2 THEN 3
    ELSE IF y EQUALS 3 OR y EQUALS 4 THEN 4
         ELSE IF y EQUALS 1 THEN 2
              ELSE 4

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `years 3.4.4 prints for certification in year` y IS
    IF y EQUALS 2 THEN LIST 3
    ELSE IF y EQUALS 3 OR y EQUALS 4 THEN LIST 4
         ELSE EMPTY

`certification in the first year has no row in 3.4.4` MEANS
    `years 3.4.4 prints for certification in year` 1 EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `certification in the first year has no row in 3.4.4`

-- 5: a certified kindergarten teacher hired at the outset for general or
-- professional teaching is as an uncertified teacher for the length of her
-- probation.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_5
GIVEN `years added by an extension notice` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `years of probation of a certified kindergarten teacher hired for general or professional teaching` `years added by an extension notice` IS
    `years of probation of an uncertified teacher` `years added by an extension notice`

-- 6: a tenured professional teacher, and a tenured kindergarten teacher,
-- moving to general teaching do not start a new probation.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_6
GIVEN `tenured professional teacher or kindergarten teacher` IS A BOOLEAN, `moving to general teaching` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `does not start a new probation` `tenured professional teacher or kindergarten teacher` `moving to general teaching` IF
    `tenured professional teacher or kindergarten teacher` AND `moving to general teaching`

§§ `2-5 together`

-- The length of a probationer's probation under 2-5. An extension notice
-- adds to it where 2 and 3 say so; 4 states none.
GIVEN p IS A `probationer`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `years of probation` p IS
    IF p's `a kindergarten teacher hired for general or professional teaching`
    THEN `years of probation of a certified kindergarten teacher hired for general or professional teaching` (p's `years added by extension notices`)
    ELSE IF p's `certified when hired`
         THEN `years of probation of a certified teacher` (p's `years added by extension notices`)
         ELSE IF p's `year of work in which certified` EQUALS 0
              THEN `years of probation of an uncertified teacher` (p's `years added by extension notices`)
              ELSE `years of probation of one certified during it` (p's `year of work in which certified`)

§§ `7-8 Visits and evaluations`

-- 7: every supervisor visits every teacher under him at least once a year
-- (time in school months); in probation, in a subject or activity he is not
-- versed in, his duty is to arrange a visit by someone else suitable.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_7
GIVEN `on probation in a subject the supervisor is not versed in` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.4 party` `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.7 the yearly visit` `on probation in a subject the supervisor is not versed in` IS
    IF `on probation in a subject the supervisor is not versed in`
    THEN PARTY `a takanon party` `the supervisor`
         MUST  `arrange a visit by someone versed in the subject`
         WITHIN 12
         LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the supervisor` BECAUSE "3.4.7: a suitable person visits in a subject the supervisor is not versed in"
    ELSE PARTY `a takanon party` `the supervisor`
         MUST  `visit the teacher`
         WITHIN 12
         LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the supervisor` BECAUSE "3.4.7: every supervisor visits every teacher at least once a year"

-- 8: where two supervisors evaluate a teacher differently in that period
-- (the general supervisor and a subject supervisor, say), a committee of
-- three decides: the district manager and two supervisors. In state-
-- religious education: the district supervisor, the district's supervisor of
-- religious education and a state-religious supervisor. "The district
-- supervisor" (מפקח המחוז) is read as the district manager, as 13 ¶2 uses the
-- two names for one office.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_8
GIVEN `two supervisors evaluated her differently in that period` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a committee of three decides her evaluation` `two supervisors evaluated her differently in that period` IF
    `two supervisors evaluated her differently in that period`

DECLARE `committee seat` IS ONE OF
    `the district manager`
    `a supervisor`
    `the district's supervisor of religious education`
    `a state-religious supervisor`

GIVEN `state-religious` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF `committee seat`
DECIDE `the committee of three` `state-religious` IS
    IF `state-religious`
    THEN LIST `the district manager`, `the district's supervisor of religious education`, `a state-religious supervisor`
    ELSE LIST `the district manager`, `a supervisor`, `a supervisor`

-- 8 ¶2: between a current and an earlier evaluation, after a break in her
-- work, the latest prevails; on a move between districts in continuous work
-- too — but "new in the district" alone does not justify recommending an
-- extension.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_8/p2
GIVEN `after a break in her work` IS A BOOLEAN, `on a move between districts in continuous work` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the latest evaluation prevails` `after a break in her work` `on a move between districts in continuous work` IF
    `after a break in her work` OR `on a move between districts in continuous work`

GIVEN `new in the district` IS A BOOLEAN, `other grounds` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `grounds to recommend an extension` `new in the district` `other grounds` IF
    `other grounds`

§§ `9-13 The yearly timetable and the decision`

-- Times are days from 1 September of the school year: 1 January is day 122,
-- 1 February 153, 1 March 181, 15 April 226, 30 June 302.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_9
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.4 party` `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.9 forms to the principals by 1 January` IS
    PARTY `the district office`
    MUST  `send each principal the principal's opinion forms, in two copies, for every teacher finishing probation that year`
    WITHIN 122
    LEST  BREACH BY `the district office` BECAUSE "3.4.9: the district office sends the principal's opinion forms by 1 January"

-- 9 ¶2: the principal returns the completed forms together by 1 February;
-- his opinion is taken into account in the decision on the continued work
-- of those finishing probation — the district manager's decision (13).
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_9/p2
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.4 party` `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.9 the forms back by 1 February` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the school principal`
    MUST  `return the completed forms together`
    WITHIN 153
    LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the school principal` BECAUSE "3.4.9: the principal returns the completed forms by 1 February"

GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.4 party` `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.9 the principal's opinion counts` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager`
    MUST  `take the principal's opinion into account in deciding on her continued work`
    LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the district manager` BECAUSE "3.4.9: the principal's opinion is taken into account"

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_9/p3
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.4 party` `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.9 to the general supervisor by 1 March` IS
    PARTY `the district office`
    MUST  `pass the forms and the treatment sheet to the general supervisor`
    WITHIN 181
    LEST  BREACH BY `the district office` BECAUSE "3.4.9: the district office passes the forms on, with the treatment sheet, by 1 March"

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_9/p4
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.4 party` `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.9 the general supervisor's position` IS
    PARTY `the general supervisor`
    MUST  `state his position on the principal's evaluations and add his own remarks`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the general supervisor` BECAUSE "3.4.9: the general supervisor states his position on the principal's evaluations"

-- 10: the general supervisor sums up his visits in the treatment sheet in an
-- opinion closing with an explicit, reasoned recommendation — one of א-ד, ד
-- for uncertified teachers only.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_10
GIVEN `the teacher is certified` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.4 party` `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.10 the recommendation` `the teacher is certified` IS
    PARTY `the general supervisor`
    MUST  `sum up his visits in the treatment sheet in an opinion closing with an explicit, reasoned recommendation` r
          PROVIDED `a recommendation open to the supervisor` r `the teacher is certified`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the general supervisor` BECAUSE "3.4.10: the treatment sheet closes with an explicit, reasoned recommendation"

GIVEN r IS A `recommendation`, `the teacher is certified` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a recommendation open to the supervisor` r `the teacher is certified` IF
    CONSIDER r
    @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_10__subpara_a
    WHEN `grant tenure` THEN TRUE
    @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_10__subpara_b
    WHEN `extend probation` THEN TRUE
    @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_10__subpara_c
    WHEN `sub-supervision and dismissal for pedagogical reasons` THEN TRUE
    @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_10__subpara_d
    WHEN `administrative dismissal` THEN NOT `the teacher is certified`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_10__subpara_d/p2
GIVEN `a professional teacher` IS A BOOLEAN, `professional supervisor's opinion attached` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the report is complete` `a professional teacher` `professional supervisor's opinion attached` IF
    (NOT `a professional teacher`) OR `professional supervisor's opinion attached`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_10__subpara_d/p3
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.4 party` `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.10 the recommendation by 15 April` IS
    PARTY `the general supervisor`
    MUST  `submit the recommendation with the principal's opinion to the district supervisor`
    WITHIN 226
    LEST  BREACH BY `the general supervisor` BECAUSE "3.4.10: the general supervisor's recommendation reaches the district supervisor by 15 April"

-- ¶4-¶5: where a supervisor's recommendation does not follow from his own
-- evaluation, the district manager checks and decides — in state-religious
-- education after consulting the district's supervisor of religious
-- education.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_10__subpara_d/p4 akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_10__subpara_d/p5
GIVEN `recommendation follows from the evaluation` IS A BOOLEAN, `state-religious` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.4 party` `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.10 a mismatch` `recommendation follows from the evaluation` `state-religious` IS
    IF `recommendation follows from the evaluation`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager`
         MUST  `check and decide the mismatch` consulted
               PROVIDED (NOT `state-religious`) OR consulted
         LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the district manager` BECAUSE "3.4.10: the district manager decides where a recommendation does not follow from its evaluation"

-- 11: a certified teacher's probation is not extended without the
-- supervision's well-reasoned opinion, the dates of the visits in detail and
-- the average of their evaluations.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_11
DECLARE `extension file` HAS
    `well-reasoned opinion`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `dates of the visits`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `average of the evaluations` IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN f IS AN `extension file`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a certified teacher's probation may be extended` f IF
    f's `well-reasoned opinion` AND f's `dates of the visits` AND f's `average of the evaluations`

-- 12: a second extension needs the Teachers' Union's prior consent, and is not
-- made but on exceptional grounds that justify asking it; the district
-- office makes the request to the union's branch.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_12
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.4 party` `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.12 no second extension without the union` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager`
    SHANT `extend probation a second time` consented exceptional
          PROVIDED (NOT consented) OR (NOT exceptional)
    LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the district manager` BECAUSE "3.4.12: a second extension needs exceptional grounds and the Teachers' Union's prior consent"

GIVEN `a second extension is sought` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.4 party` `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.12 the request to the union` `a second extension is sought` IS
    IF `a second extension is sought`
    THEN PARTY `the district office`
         MUST  `refer the request to the union's branch`
         LEST  BREACH BY `the district office` BECAUSE "3.4.12: the district office asks the union's branch"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- 13: the district manager decides extension or tenure; in state-religious
-- education after consulting the district's supervisor of religious
-- education, and if he does not accept that supervisor's view the matter
-- goes to the head office.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_13 akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_13/p2
DECLARE `who decides` IS ONE OF `the district manager decides`, `the head office decides`

GIVEN `state-religious` IS A BOOLEAN, `accepts the religious supervisor's view` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `who decides`
DECIDE `who decides tenure` `state-religious` `accepts the religious supervisor's view` IS
    IF `state-religious` AND NOT `accepts the religious supervisor's view`
    THEN `the head office decides`
    ELSE `the district manager decides`

GIVEN `state-religious` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.4 party` `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.13 consulting in state-religious education` `state-religious` IS
    IF `state-religious`
    THEN PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager`
         MUST  `consult the district's supervisor of religious education before deciding`
         LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the district manager` BECAUSE "3.4.13: in state-religious education the district manager decides after consulting"
    ELSE FULFILLED

§§ `14-20 Kindergarten teachers, the uncertified, warnings`

-- 14: a kindergarten teacher is, for these provisions, as a general teacher
-- (the rules above serve her unchanged); for the supervisor's visit of 7, a
-- visit of two hours at least counts.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_14
GIVEN `minutes of the visit` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a visit to a kindergarten counts under 3.4.7` `minutes of the visit` IF
    `minutes of the visit` AT LEAST 120

-- 15: within 3, an uncertified teacher at stage A or A+ gets no tenure in her
-- fourth year of probation; a notice from the district manager of a further
-- year, for administrative reasons, is sent to her instead.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_15
GIVEN p IS A `probationer`, `year of probation` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a further year for administrative reasons` p `year of probation` IF
        NOT p's `certified when hired`
    AND p's `year of work in which certified` EQUALS 0
    AND NOT p's `uncertified stage` EQUALS `other stage`
    AND `year of probation` EQUALS 4

-- 16א: the district office sends the notices of 15, first checking (1) that
-- the teacher was not certified after the Passover exam and (2) her private
-- address.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_16__subpara_a akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_16__subpara_a/p2
GIVEN `checked no certification after the Passover exam` IS A BOOLEAN, `checked the private address` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.4 party` `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.16א the district office sends the notice` `checked no certification after the Passover exam` `checked the private address` IS
    IF `the notice may be sent` `checked no certification after the Passover exam` `checked the private address`
    THEN PARTY `the district office`
         MUST  `send the notice of a further year of probation`
         LEST  BREACH BY `the district office` BECAUSE "3.4.16א: the district office sends the notices of 15"
    ELSE PARTY `the district office`
         MUST  `check her certification and private address`
         HENCE (PARTY `the district office`
                MUST  `send the notice of a further year of probation`
                LEST  BREACH BY `the district office` BECAUSE "3.4.16א: the district office sends the notices of 15")
         LEST  BREACH BY `the district office` BECAUSE "3.4.16א: the district office checks before sending a notice"

GIVEN `checked no certification after the Passover exam` IS A BOOLEAN, `checked the private address` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the notice may be sent` `checked no certification after the Passover exam` `checked the private address` IF
    @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_16__subpara_a__cls_1
        `checked no certification after the Passover exam`
    @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_16__subpara_a__cls_2
    AND `checked the private address`

-- 16ב: a teacher found certified meanwhile: the district manager weighs
-- tenure or a further year for pedagogical reasons, giving his reasons.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_16__subpara_b
GIVEN `found certified meanwhile` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.4 party` `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.16ב one certified meanwhile` `found certified meanwhile` IS
    IF `found certified meanwhile`
    THEN PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager`
         MUST  `weigh tenure or a further year for pedagogical reasons, with reasons`
         LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the district manager` BECAUSE "3.4.16ב: the district manager weighs tenure or a further year for one certified meanwhile"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- 17: the district managers send warning letters in a set form to every
-- uncertified teacher in her third year of probation, graduates of every kind
-- of teachers' and kindergarten teachers' training institution included; the
-- last day for them is 19's 30 June (day 302).
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_17
GIVEN `uncertified` IS A BOOLEAN, `year of probation` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.4 party` `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.17 warning letters` `uncertified` `year of probation` IS
    IF `uncertified` AND `year of probation` EQUALS 3
    THEN PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager`
         MUST  `send a warning letter in the set form`
         WITHIN `the last day for notices and warnings`
         LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the district manager` BECAUSE "3.4.17/19: the warning is sent by 30 June"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- 18: copies of the warning letters go together to the personnel division
-- at the end; for a state-religious institution the copy goes to the head
-- of the religious education division, who passes it on.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_18
GIVEN `state-religious` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.4 party` `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.18 copies of the warnings` `state-religious` IS
    IF `state-religious`
    THEN PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager`
         MUST  `send the copy to the head of the religious education division`
         HENCE (PARTY `the head of the religious education division`
                MUST  `pass the copy on to the personnel division`
                LEST  BREACH BY `the head of the religious education division` BECAUSE "3.4.18: the head of religious education passes the copy on")
         LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the district manager` BECAUSE "3.4.18: the copy goes to the head of religious education"
    ELSE PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager`
         MUST  `send the copies of the warning letters to the personnel division together at the end`
         LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the district manager` BECAUSE "3.4.18: copies of the warnings go to the personnel division"

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_19
`the last day for notices and warnings` MEANS 302

-- The extension notices' own deadline; the warnings' is in 17.
GIVEN `an extension was decided` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.4 party` `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.19 extension notices by 30 June` `an extension was decided` IS
    IF `an extension was decided`
    THEN PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager`
         MUST  `send an extension notice`
         WITHIN `the last day for notices and warnings`
         LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the district manager` BECAUSE "3.4.19: extension notices are sent by 30 June"
    ELSE FULFILLED

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_20
GIVEN `a non-official teacher` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `3.4 party` `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.20 a copy to the owner` `a non-official teacher` IS
    IF `a non-official teacher`
    THEN PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager`
         MUST  `send a copy of the notice to the owner`
         LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the district manager` BECAUSE "3.4.20: a copy of the notice goes to the owner of a non-official teacher's institution"
    ELSE FULFILLED

